---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About | Buy Better Finds" description="Learn about Buy Better Finds and our approach to practical product discovery.">
  <article class="article">
    <div class="eyebrow">About us</div>
    <h1>Buy less regret. Find better products.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Buy Better Finds is an independent product-discovery website focused on useful recommendations, comparisons, and buying guidance.</p>
    <p>Our goal is to help shoppers understand what matters before spending their money. Instead of overwhelming you with endless choices, we focus on specific products and practical information that makes comparisons easier.</p>

    <h2>Our editorial approach</h2>
    <p>We research specific products, consider intended use and practical features, explain meaningful tradeoffs, and identify the type of shopper a product may suit best. We aim to add original commentary and analysis rather than simply reproducing retailer descriptions.</p>

    <h2>Independence and affiliate relationships</h2>
    <p>Buy Better Finds may participate in affiliate programs. If you purchase through a qualifying affiliate link, we may earn a commission at no additional cost to you. Affiliate compensation does not guarantee a recommendation or positive coverage.</p>

    <h2>Prices and product information</h2>
    <p>Prices, availability, specifications, promotions, shipping, and return policies can change. Always confirm current information with the retailer or manufacturer before purchasing.</p>

    <h2>Our promise</h2>
    <p>Clearer information, useful recommendations, transparent affiliate relationships, and a better shopping experience.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
